{"id":"e27510905d","t":"The Reversal Of My Life As A Side Character","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/The-Reversal-Of-My-Life-As-A-Side-Character-193x278.jpg","n":78,"l":78,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character"},"u":1795038465730,"desc":"في خضم حياة روتينية ومملة، ظهرت لعبة *مصير الابطال* وكأنها جاءت بمحض القدر. بعد عشر سنوات من اللعب، تمكنت أخيرًا من إنهاء اللعبة، لكنني شعرت بالفراغ عند العودة إلى الحياة العادية. فجأة ظهرت رسالة على الشاشة: “هل ترغب في خوض مغامرة جديدة؟ [نعم/لا].” لم أكن أدرك حينها أنني سأستيقظ في جسد غريب وفي مكان مجهول. “عليك أن تتذكر، أنا الآن كاليكس شيكين.” وهكذا… “سأصبح بطل هذا العالم!”","type":"Manhwa","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اكشن","خارق للطبيعه","دراما","فنتازيا"],"src":{"ml":"the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character|/manga/the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character|/manga/the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character|/manga/the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character|/manga/the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character|/manga/the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character|/manga/the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character|/manga/the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character|/manga/the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character|/manga/the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character|/manga/the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-reversal-of-my-life-as-a-side-character|/manga/the-reversal-of